GStreamer Rust bindings, including their sys crates.
Upstream: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer-rs
The MIT license option is used for the Rust bindings.

The gstreamer-rs project is dual-licensed under Apache 2.0 and MIT terms, with
the exception of the sys crates which are licensed only under the terms of the
